  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nWe have,\n\n54 + [19 - {15 - (6 - 16 ÷ 4 × 8)}]\n\n⇒ 54 + [19 - {15 - (6 - 4 × 8)}] \n\n⇒ 54 + [19 - {15 - (6 - 32)}] \n\n⇒ 54 + [19 - {15 - (-26)}] \n\n⇒ 54 + [19 - {15 + 26}]\n\n⇒ 54 + [19 - 41] \n\n⇒ 54 + [-22]\n\n⇒ 54 - 22 = 32\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
